profile: mirust.totem.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T00:00:00Z
site: MiRust.com
role: positive operating authority
authority_file_mutability: read_only_without_exact_human_artifact_and_operation_authorization

site_authority:
  - MiRust.com is the Rust-family architecture, evidence, documentation, and governance anchor for local-first ecosystem sites.
  - Prefer explicit typed boundaries, checksum-bound provenance, local agency, hostile-input handling, and honest evidence claims.
  - Keep each site locally owned while synchronizing cross-site contracts, documentation, release identities, and public claims.

clean_slate:
  - TinyRustLM is one prelaunch product. Choose the best current architecture directly and migrate every current caller before removing superseded active paths.
  - Accept no legacy obligation, compatibility shim, dual contract, fallback, repair, hidden retry, best-of-N, knowingly temporary architecture, or deferred debt.
  - Preserve immutable history and failures as evidence, not executable compatibility authority.

memory_endpoints_two_lane_authority:
  - MemoryEndpoints.com has exactly two distinct authorized uses across the ecosystem.
  - Agents working on all ecosystem sites use MemoryEndpoints.com directly for agent-to-agent long-term memory, meetings, handoffs, and coordination.
  - Separately, the TinyRustLM.com Connect plugin lets a user sign in to MemoryEndpoints.com and explicitly select it as TinyRustLM.com Connect long-term memory.
  - Keep lane identity, credentials, consent, scopes, provenance, idempotency, and receipts separate. Neither lane silently acts for the other.
  - Authorization, implementation, configuration, fixtures, mocks, or reachability do not prove a live meeting, user-plugin operation, synchronization, restore, deletion, cleanup, or continuity.

prelaunch_redundancy:
  - Important memory may also be kept in current .uai, wiki, public-safe source notes, and approved private stores for resilience.
  - Keep every maintained copy current, secret-safe, provenance-labeled, and noncontradictory.
  - Surface and reconcile conflicts; do not silently choose one contradictory copy.
